OverTheWire Bandit: Level 22 → 23

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 23.
A cron job runs a script that writes the password to a file with a predictable name in /tmp.

Steps
Log in as bandit22:
ssh bandit22@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
View the cron job configuration:
cat /etc/cron.d/cronjob_bandit23
Inspect the executed script:
cat /usr/bin/cronjob_bandit23.sh
Identify the generated filename and read it:
cat /tmp/<identified_filename>

Result
The file contains the password for Bandit Level 23.
